    补充后令牌不足记 token，配额 used+成本>limit 记 quota（可同增）；
    未配桶/配额的维度与仅容量（或排空）阻塞均不记。chosen/chosen_quotas
    为 evaluate_admit 已补充/滚窗后的在配 (对象, 成本) 列表。每维 O(1)。"""
    bucket_costs = {id(bucket): cost for bucket, cost in chosen}
    quota_costs = {id(quota): cost for quota, cost in chosen_quotas}
    for scope, dim_id, cost in (
        ("B", backend_id, costs[0]),
        ("C", c, costs[1]),
        ("S", s, costs[2]),
    ):
        bucket = buckets.get((scope, dim_id))
        quota = quotas.get((scope, dim_id))
        if bucket is None and quota is None:
            # 该维既无桶也无配额：不记账。
            continue
        row = limit_window(scope, dim_id, now)
        if admitted:
            row[0] = min(METRIC_CAP, row[0] + 1)
            row[1] = min(METRIC_CAP, row[1] + cost)
            continue
        if bucket is not None and bucket["t"] < bucket_costs[id(bucket)]:
            # 令牌不足（补充后仍小于该维成本）。
            row[2] = min(METRIC_CAP, row[2] + 1)
        if (
            quota is not None
            and quota["used"] + quota_costs[id(quota)] > quota["limit"]
        ):
            # 固定窗配额不足。
            row[3] = min(METRIC_CAP, row[3] + 1)

